	(text "CROWBAR (D061): above about 6.3 to 7.8 V the zener fires the SCR, which holds the rail near 1 V until the supply is switched off; the diode takes crossed leads.\nRun the supply with its limit at 1.5 A: the SCR then holds a fault for as long as it takes to notice. At 3 A or more it wants a clip-on heatsink."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 124.46 0)
		(effects
